{
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.0": "FIRE! Get it off me! OFF!!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.1": "No fire! Me hate fire! Back!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_fire.2": "Burnin! BACK! BACK!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.0": "Get dat beast off me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.1": "Back, you stinkin animal!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_beasts.2": "No teeth! Me hate teeth!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.0": "Dat my blood... MY blood!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.1": "Me bleedin! Somebody do somethin!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.afraid.fears_blood.2": "Too much red... me gone!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.0": "To me! Smash dem all!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.1": "Up, you dogs! Kill it dead!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.rally.2": "Everybody on dem! NOW!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.0": "%1$s. Me %2$s, of %3$s. Remember dat. Me remember you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.1": "So you da one. %2$s, of %3$s. Say my name when you run, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.first.2": "Look at me, %1$s. %2$s of %3$s. Last face you see.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.0": "You. Again. %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.1": "%1$s. Me not forget.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.met.2": "Back, %1$s? Good. More smashin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.0": "Runnin again, %1$s? All me saw last time was yer back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.1": "%1$s! Da one dat ran! No runnin now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.fled.2": "You ran from %2$s once, %1$s. Yer legs remember.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.0": "You had me down, %1$s. Should've smashed me dead.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.1": "%1$s. Me healed. You healed?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.beaten.2": "Left me in da dirt, %1$s. Big mistake.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.0": "%1$s let me live. Me owe you nothin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.1": "You let me live, %1$s. Me thinkin if dat kind or dumb.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.spared.2": "%1$s. You stopped yer hand. Me won't stop mine.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.0": "Me kill you, %1$s? Me kill you proper dis time.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.1": "%1$s! Me wear yer face! Come get da rest!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.killed.2": "Back from dead, %1$s? Lie down again.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.0": "%1$s. You put knife on me and ask things. Here answer.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.1": "You made me talk, %1$s. Now me make you scream.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.questioned.2": "%1$s. Me told you nothin. Remember dat.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.0": "Not yet!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.1": "Dat all?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.not_yet.2": "Me not die dat easy!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.0": "%s is done! Who next?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.1": "Me wear %s's hed tonight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.gloat.2": "Dat how %s dies. Remember!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.0": "Who captain now? %s is!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.1": "Kneel, all! %s lead now!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.risen.2": "Me %s now. Say it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.0": "Another hed for %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.1": "Higher! %s climb higher!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.climbed.2": "Who stop %s now? Nobody!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.0": "%1$s! %1$s! SMASH!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.1": "BIG %s! BIG!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.cheer.2": "%1$s! Spill blood for %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.0": "You think me dead, %1$s? Me too.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.1": "%1$s! Me crawled up outta da dirt for you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.slain.2": "Look what you did to me, %1$s. Now me do dat to you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.0": "Me wuz cold, %1$s. Somethin warmed me up. Not nice.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.1": "Kill me, %1$s. Go on. Me seen da other side. Not scared.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.raised.2": "%1$s. Me remember da dark you put me in. Me brought some back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.0": "%1$s. Dem laugh at me cuz of you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.1": "You shamed me in front of my own, %1$s. Me wash it off wit yer blood.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.shamed.2": "%1$s! Every night me dream yer face! Me smash it!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.0": "You killed one of ours, %1$s. Me come for da debt.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.1": "%1$s. Somebody gotta pay for him. You.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger.2": "Me swore it over his body, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.0": "You kill me brother, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.1": "My brother's blood on you, %1$s. Me take it back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.avenger_brother.2": "%1$s. Me buried brother. Now me bury you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.0": "Get off %s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.1": "Nobody smash %s but me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.brother.2": "Brother! Me comin!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.0": "You... let me up? %1$s, you dumb.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.1": "Why, %1$s? Why you not kill?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.let_up.2": "Me not forget dis, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.0": "Don't look at me! NOBODY look at me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.1": "%1$s... me kill you for dis!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.shamed.2": "No... not in front of dem...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.0": "%1$s. Me knelt to you once. Dat over.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.1": "Me served you, %1$s. Death let me go. Me my own now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.sworn.2": "%1$s! My oath died wit me. Me didn't.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.0": "You think me kneel forever, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.1": "%1$s. Me wore yer leash. Now you eat my blade.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.betrayed.2": "Me never yours, %1$s. Just waitin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.0": "Coward comes! %1$s, me waited all day!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.1": "%1$s! Yer challenge rotted on da gate. You too.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.again.coward.2": "You nail challenge and run, %1$s? Me nail you up next.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.0": "Bend? Me been dead, %1$s. Nothin left to bend.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.1": "Yer light nothin to me, %1$s. Kill me again. Try.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.deathless.2": "Me fear nothin now, %1$s. Specially not you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.0": "You too weak to own me, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.1": "Kneel to you, %1$s? Me smashed better than you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.refuses.unbent.2": "Ha! Dat all you got, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.0": "Dat fire in you, %1$s... me follow it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.1": "You beat me fair, %1$s. My axe yours.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.valor.2": "Me know strong when it stand on me. Lead, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.0": "Wha... what you put in my hed, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.1": "Me hear old voice givin orders. Yours now, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.sworn.binding.2": "My hands yours, %1$s. Me can't stop dem.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.no": "No. Not now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.nothing": "No old tribe left to smash, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.0": "%2$s? Me know back gate. Give me till dawn, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.1": "Me burn %2$s's stores and bring you da rest, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.raid.2": "%2$s bleed before sun, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.0": "Dem take me back, %1$s. Dumb. Me listen.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.1": "Two days, %1$s. Me come back knowin what dem fear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.spy.2": "Me drink at dem fire and count dem knives, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.0": "Back, %1$s. Not empty-handed.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.1": "Orc back, %1$s. You miss orc?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.order.back.2": "Me here, %1$s. Where we smash?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.0": "Me done kneelin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.1": "You thought me yours? Me wuz waitin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.betrays.2": "Back to my own. Watch yer back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.0": "%1$s! You nailed it on my gate! Come! Just you and me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.1": "Back, all! %1$s MINE!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.challenge.answer.2": "Challenger came, %1$s. My lads watch you die.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.0": "My warchiefs stand. While %1$s of dem live, you no touch me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.1": "Ha! Kill my captains first. All %1$s!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.captain.king_guarded.2": "You no get my seat while %1$s captains breathe.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.0": "Captain? No captain here, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.1": "Ask other one, %1$s. Me know nothin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.none.2": "Nothin to tell, %1$s. Honest.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.0": "OK, %1$s, OK! %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.1": "You not hear it from me, %1$s. %2$s",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.captain.told.2": "Fine! %2$s Now let orc go, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.thick_hide.told": "Blades barely bite %s. Dem say.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.arrow_proof.told": "Arrows bounce off %s. Don't waste yer arrows.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fire_born.told": "%s walk in fire like a bath.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.heavy_handed.told": "When %s hit you, legs snap. Ask anybody limpin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.hard_to_kill.told": "%s left for dead before. Always get back up.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.blood_rage.told": "Hurt %s and he get worse. Faster. Angrier.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.venomous.told": "%s put nasty stuff on his blades. Cuts go green.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.rallying.told": "When %s start bellowin, all us come runnin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.deathless.told": "%s died once. Whatever brung him back took out da fear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.soft_to_arrows.told": "%s hate archers. Arrow went right through him once.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.glass_jaw.told": "%s got soft hed. One good club and he see stars.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.blind_side.told": "%s only watch who he fightin. Hit him from side.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.burns_easily.told": "%s go up like dry straw.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_fire.told": "%s no go near fire. Scream at a torch.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_beasts.told": "%s run from wolves, bears, anybody on a horse.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.captain.jaymoskingdoms.trait.fears_blood.told": "Make %s bleed and he panic. No can look.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.book.jaymoskingdoms.captain_orders.page": "To da camp, from da chief.\n\n%1$s hold da road dis moon. Stay outta his way.\n\n%2$s\n\nBurn dis.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.0": "Nailed to a stake at the edge of %2$s's land, in %1$s's hand: \"%3$s, me comin for you. Me smash you.\"",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.1": "A rag on a spear outside the camps of %2$s, daubed in blood: %1$s means to kill %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.news.jaymoskingdoms.captain.threat.2": "Word from %2$s's camps: %1$s has sworn on his blade to see %3$s dead.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.hunter.0": "Dere! Dat one!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.hunter.1": "Chief want yer hed!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.hunter.2": "Smell dat? Fresh trail!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.hunter.3": "No runnin dis time!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.called.0": "%2$s heard horn, %1$s! Where dem?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.called.1": "Chief send us. Friend of %2$s not alone.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.called.2": "Raiders on yer land, %1$s? We smash dem!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.ally.0": "Come out an fight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.ally.1": "Smash dem for da chief!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.ally.2": "Where dem run?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.ally.3": "Nobody touch our friends!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.calm.0": "Dem no think of you, %1$s. Keep it so.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.calm.1": "You and %2$s? No fight. Yet.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.calm.2": "You nothin to %2$s, %1$s. Good to be nothin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.wary.0": "Yer name come up round fires, %1$s. Not nice.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.wary.1": "Round here, %2$s watchin you, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.wary.2": "Dem countin, %1$s. Every one of ours you put down.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.angry.0": "Chief spit when yer name said, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.angry.1": "All of %2$s want you skinned. Few bent coppers make dem soft.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.angry.2": "Walk quiet out here, %1$s. Dem angry.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.hunted.0": "Dem sent hunters, %1$s. Me not stay.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.hunted.1": "Hunters of %2$s smell you. Chief put price on yer hed.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.hunted.2": "You dead thing walkin, %1$s. Chief say.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.truce.0": "You got truce wit %2$s, %1$s. Don't break it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.truce.1": "Horn blown for you. Dem let you pass. For now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.truce.2": "Truce holds, %1$s. Hit one of us and it over.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.friend.0": "Yer good wit %2$s fires, %1$s. Call, dem come.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.friend.1": "Chief of %2$s say yer name like one of us.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.mood.friend.2": "Friend of %2$s, you. Raiders come yer door, horn go up here too.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.none.0": "Empty hands, %1$s? Take %2$s bent coppers to cool chief.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.none.1": "No gold, no peace. %2$s bent coppers, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.none.2": "You got nothin me want. Come back wit %2$s bent coppers.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.part.0": "Dat a start, %1$s. Chief want more.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.part.1": "Some forgive. Not all.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.part.2": "Dat take edge off. Only edge.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.paid.0": "Paid, %1$s. Chief forget. For now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.paid.1": "Dat do. Yer name clean round fires.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.paid.2": "Good. We square, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.gift.0": "Gift? Nobody owe, still you give. Chief hear of dis, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.gift.1": "Ha! Gift for nothin. You strange, %1$s. Good strange.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.tribe.tribute.gift.2": "Gifts make friends round fires. Remember, so we do.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.pit.0": "See chief? Beat our champ in pit, %1$s. Den we talk.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.pit.1": "Nobody walk in. Get in pit, %1$s, and stand when done.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.hall.0": "Chief at end of hall, %1$s. Get there before hall get you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.hall.1": "Run to throne, %1$s. Watch feet. Heh.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.again.0": "You prove already, %1$s. Don't push.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.again.1": "Chief seen you. Once plenty.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.none.0": "No chief to see today.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.trial.none.1": "Not now, %1$s. Go 'way.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.trial.champion.0": "Fresh meat for da pit!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.trial.champion.1": "Get in, tiny one!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.trial.champion.2": "Me fold you in half!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.trial.passed.pit": "Hah! Dat one can fight! Let dem through!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.trial.passed.hall": "Sneaky one! Chief like sneaky ones!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.varro.0": "Burnin on my hed... %1$s. Me come when you call.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.varro.1": "Me feel it. Yer mark, %1$s. Me go home. For now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.varro.2": "%1$s. Me not know what you did. Me know yer fight when me hear it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.varro.cry": "FOR %1$s!! SMASH!!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.grimsby.0": "Real axe? For me? Me swing where you say, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.grimsby.1": "My own no know till too late, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.grimsby.2": "Me yer blade in dem camp, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.ambrose.0": "Me... not angry no more. Me walk wit you, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.ambrose.1": "Quiet in hed. Lead, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.ambrose.2": "Hrrm. %1$s. Me go where you go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.thessaly.0": "Why hed itch, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.thessaly.1": "Leave me, %1$s. Me goin home.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.inbalm.thessaly.2": "Get out my eyes! ...What you do, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.chant_0": "Blood for da fire!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.chant_1": "Drums call! Smash dem!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.chant_2": "Feel da wolf in you!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.chant_3": "HOO! HOO! HAAA!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.tail.jaymoskingdoms.smelled.tribe.0": "Sniff sniff. Tail-man! Hidin it! Ha!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.tail.jaymoskingdoms.smelled.tribe.1": "You stink of tail, %s. Why tie it? Nobody care here.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.tail.jaymoskingdoms.smelled.tribe.2": "Somethin wit tail. Under coat. We smell it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.afraid.0": "No! %1$s, no! Me tell all!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.afraid.1": "Wait, wait! What you want?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.afraid.2": "Mercy, %1$s! Ask! Me answer!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.defiant.0": "Do it, %1$s. Get nothin from me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.defiant.1": "*spits* Go on. Ask.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.opening.defiant.2": "Me got nothin to say.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.refuse.0": "Me said nothin. Me say nothin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.refuse.1": "Ask all you want, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.refuse.2": "*they glare at you and say nothing*",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.broken.0": "OK! OK! Just stop!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.broken.1": "No more, %1$s. Me talk.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.broken.2": "*they flinch from the edge* Fine! Ask!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.held.0": "Dat all you got?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.held.1": "*they grit their teeth and hold your stare*",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.held.2": "You no scare me, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.never.0": "Kill me or let me go. Me done talkin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.never.1": "*they shut their eyes and wait for the blow*",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.never.2": "Nothin you do make me talk.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.rough_broken.0": "Agh! Stop! Me talk, me talk!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.rough_broken.1": "*they cry out* Enough, %1$s! Ask!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.threat.rough_broken.2": "No more! Please! What you want?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.broken.0": "*they look away first* ...Fine. Ask.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.broken.1": "Stop lookin at me. Me tell you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.broken.2": "*their jaw trembles* What you wanna know, %1$s?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.held.0": "*they stare right back*",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.held.1": "Look all you want.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.stare.held.2": "Yer eyes no scare me, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.swear.0": "Me swear. Never hit you, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.swear.1": "On my life, never lift hand on you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.swear.2": "Me swear! Never again, %1$s. Never.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.none.0": "No one. Me alone out here.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.none.1": "Nobody, %1$s. Just me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.none.2": "None of mine near. Me swear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.some.0": "Got %2$s of us about. %3$s got weapons.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.some.1": "%2$s close, %1$s. %3$s guards.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.nearby.some.2": "Maybe %2$s near... %3$s wit weapons.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.none.0": "Nobody! Me answer to nobody!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.none.1": "No boss, %1$s. Me nobody's.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.none.2": "Nobody. Me swear.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.realm.0": "%2$s. %2$s rule %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.realm.1": "Me serve %3$s. %2$s sit throne.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.realm.2": "%2$s! You want %2$s of %3$s, not me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.empty.0": "%2$s no got boss now. Nobody take seat.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.empty.1": "Nobody rule %2$s now. Truth.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.empty.2": "Seat of %2$s empty, %1$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.camp.0": "%2$s lead us. All of %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.camp.1": "We run wit %2$s. All %3$s do.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.leader.camp.2": "%2$s word we live by. %3$s.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.none.0": "No home. Me sleep where me fall.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.none.1": "Nowhere, %1$s. Nowhere.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.none.2": "Home? Me got none.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.realm.0": "Seat of %4$s about %2$s blocks %3$s of here.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.realm.1": "%4$s. Go %3$s, %2$s blocks maybe.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.realm.2": "%3$s! %2$s blocks %3$s, dat where %4$s seat!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.camp.0": "Camp %3$s of here. %2$s blocks, maybe.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.camp.1": "Go %3$s, %2$s blocks. You smell fires.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.question.home.camp.2": "%4$s %3$s, %2$s blocks off.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.outlaw_opening.0": "What you want?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.outlaw_opening.1": "Hands where me see. Or me take hands.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.outlaw_opening.2": "Small thing walk up to orc. Brave. Or stupid.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.outlaw_opening.3": "Talk fast. Or go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_outlaw.0": "Name is mine. You no get it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_outlaw.1": "Call me what you want. You no call long.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_outlaw.2": "Nobody. Go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_wary.0": "Name is for krew. You not krew. Not yet.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_wary.1": "Dis place not for you. Me name not for you too.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_wary.2": "Keep hand. Me watch you first.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_wary.3": "Me know your kind. Show me different. Den names.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_wary.4": "Boyz tell me if you worth knowin. Till den, no.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.strafe_0": "Can't hit from here. Move!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.strafe_1": "He dodge! Me go side.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.strafe_2": "Bad angle. Step!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.strafe_3": "Miss, miss, miss! Change feet.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.seek_sight_0": "No see him. Find better spot.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.seek_sight_1": "Wall in way! Find hole!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.seek_sight_2": "Where he go? Me find him.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.seek_sight_3": "Wait. Need see.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.close_in_0": "Too far. Go closer!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.close_in_1": "Shots waste. Get close.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.close_in_2": "Me move up.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.close_in_3": "Forward! Can't hit from here!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.back_off_0": "Too close! Back!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.back_off_1": "Back off. Shoot proper.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.back_off_2": "Fall back. Shoot.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.back_off_3": "Need room. Back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.flank_0": "Go round side!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.flank_1": "Hit him from side.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.flank_2": "New angle. Circle!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.flank_3": "Straight no work. Go round.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.cover_0": "Hide. Let him come.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.cover_1": "Wait in dark. Then hit.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.cover_2": "No see me. He slip.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.ranged.cover_3": "Down. He wonder where orc go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.kindhearted.help.0": "Hold on! Me got you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.kindhearted.help.1": "Easy. Whoever you are. Up you come.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.cheerful.help.0": "Up! Not so bad. Ha!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.cheerful.help.1": "Fall down? Me patch you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.devout.help.0": "Spirits say help. Lie still.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.devout.help.1": "Nobody die where me can help.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.dutiful.help.0": "Stay down. Me see to you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.dutiful.help.1": "One of ours hurt! Me come!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.brave.help.0": "Forget dem. Me get you out.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.brave.help.1": "Bite teeth, friend. Me here.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.proud.help.0": "You worth trouble. Little bit. Hold still.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.proud.help.1": "Big name like you, in dirt? No.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.greedy.help.0": "You need help. Help cost.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.greedy.help.1": "Me get you up. Then you pay.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.suspicious.help.0": "Me know you. Not make me sorry.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.suspicious.help.1": "Fine. Me watch hands.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.timid.help.0": "Safe? ...Fine. Quick.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.timid.help.1": "Nothin come back, please. Hold still.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.hotheaded.help.0": "Who do this? Me break dem nose. Up!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.hotheaded.help.1": "Get up! We find dem!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.spiteful.help.0": "Only cos it you. Tell nobody.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.spiteful.help.1": "You owe me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.gloomy.help.0": "Course dis happen. Hold still.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.gloomy.help.1": "Everybody end up in dirt. Someday.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.spiteful.jeer.0": "Ha! Look at you. Down in dirt!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.spiteful.jeer.1": "Serve you right. No help from me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.greedy.fee.0": "%s. Good trade.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.temperament.jaymoskingdoms.greedy.fee.1": "%s for trouble. Cheap.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_refused": "Me name not your business.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.disarmed.0": "Me axe! Where me axe?!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.disarmed.1": "You pay for dat! Me crush you!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.disarmed.2": "No weapon! Still got fists!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.disarmed.3": "Grah! Where it go?!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.rearmed.sidearm.0": "Got other one. Good.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.rearmed.sidearm.1": "Not done! Orc never done!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.rearmed.pickup.0": "Dis one do.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.rearmed.pickup.1": "Back to smashin!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.talk.jaymoskingdoms.rearmed.pickup.2": "Now. Where me was? Smashin.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name.0": "Me %s. You remember.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name.1": "%s. Dat me name.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name.2": "Huh? Me %s. Who you?",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_ruler.0": "You stand before %s %s. %s is mine!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.dialogue.chat.jaymoskingdoms.name_ruler.1": "Me %s %s. Me rule %s. Kneel.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_0": "SMASH!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_1": "Fresh meat!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_2": "For boss!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_3": "Crack bones!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_4": "Skulls for pile!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.cry_5": "Run, small thing! RUN!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.rage_0": "RAAGH! You pay!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.rage_1": "BLOOD! Me smell own blood!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.rage_2": "Now me ANGRY!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.brawl_0": "Me smash you, skinny!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.brawl_1": "You look at me? Fists up!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.brawl_2": "Dat my meat! Come get!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.brawl_3": "Bored. Hit you now.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.challenge_0": "Chief old, chief slow! Me chief now!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.challenge_1": "Me strongest! Fight, chief!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.challenge_2": "Dat axe mine! Give!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.challenge_3": "Too long you chief! Fight!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.reply_0": "HA! Come get, runt!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.reply_1": "Me eat you for breakfast!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.reply_2": "Try! Me break you in half!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_0": "Hit him! Hit him!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_1": "HAR HAR! He fall!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_2": "Bash his head!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_3": "Ooooh, dat hurt tomorrow!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_4": "Me bet two bones on big one!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.jeer_5": "Kill him! No, wait. Hit more!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.win_0": "Me best! Me best!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.win_1": "Who next? Nobody. Good.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.win_2": "HAR! Dat teach you!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.win_3": "Stay down, wimp!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.lose_0": "Ow... tooth gone...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.lose_1": "Was luck... next time...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.lose_2": "Okay okay! Me done!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.lose_3": "Ughh... head...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.new_chief_0": "Me chief now! All bow!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.new_chief_1": "New chief! Same smash, more me!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.new_chief_2": "Me was right! Me boss!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.new_chief_3": "WAAAGH! Me got big axe!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.deposed_0": "Grrr... wait. Me come back...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.deposed_1": "Me was chief... good chief...",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.deposed_2": "Not over, runt!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.toss_0": "Toothpick! Go poke him!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.toss_1": "Catch, gobbo!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.toss_2": "Fly, little green!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.toss_3": "Hur hur, gobbo go splat!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.freed_0": "Oi! Our gobbo! Get him!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.freed_1": "Who break chain?! Smash!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.speech.jaymoskingdoms.orc.freed_2": "Thief! Work gobbo, mine!",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.somewhere": "da soft-lands",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.cover.0": "WAR BOOK.\nOf %1$s.\n\n%2$s say write it so me write it. Dis mine. Touch it and me eat you.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.cover.1": "Dis da book of %1$s.\n\nWritten by one who can write. %2$s say dat make him special. Me say it make him soft.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.raid.0": "Raid. Went to %1$s. Took grain, took pots, took a goat dat bit. Burned da barn. Burnin is da best part. Da tribe ate good dat night.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.raid.1": "Raid on %1$s. Dey locked da gate. Gate is wood. Wood burn. Dey did not think about dat.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.raid.2": "Marked da day with a red hand. %1$s folk run slow. Me count eleven chickens and one cart. Cart is for da chief. Chickens are for me.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.brawl.0": "Brawl at da fire. %1$s put %2$s face in da stew. Stew was ruined. Fight was good. Both still alive. Dis time.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.brawl.1": "%1$s say he stronger dan %2$s. Dey go outside. Me bet two bones on %1$s. Me lose bones.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.brawl.2": "No more brawls in da camp, say da chief. So we brawl behind da camp. %2$s lost a tooth. %1$s found it. Keeps it.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.broken.0": "We broke da chief of %1$s. %2$s did da last blow but me did da first. Write dat down. Me did da first.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.broken.1": "Chief of %1$s fall. Dey cry. We take his big spoon and his big hat. %2$s wear hat now. Hat too small.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.broken.2": "Dey say da chief of %1$s cannot be broke. Dey were wrong. Dey were VERY wrong. %2$s has da proof in a bag.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.next.0": "Next is %1$s. %2$s say wait for da moon. Me say moon is just a rock. We go anyway.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.next.1": "Who comin next? %1$s. Da walls dere are bigger now. Good. Bigger walls fall louder.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.next.2": "%2$s been lookin toward %1$s all week. Eyes like a hungry dog. Soon.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.0": "Da tall broken stones. Dey hum at night. Me put ear on one. It hummed back. Me not do dat again.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.1": "Shaman say da stones are teeth. Of what, he not say. Shaman not say lots of things.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.2": "Saw a rock da size of a hill stand up and walk. Me was not drunk. Me was a little drunk.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.3": "Dey say da sky used to be underneath. Dat is stupid. Where would da birds go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.4": "Green giant by da windy stone. Big. Grass grow where it step. Grass dat grows is bad, say da chief. Grass is for goats.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.5": "Cold stone in da north, all white. Da big thing in it breathe frost. Me feet still hurt.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.6": "Some stones pull da axe from your hand. Me lost two axes. Dey are still dere. Stuck. Don't go.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.7": "Glowy trees by da sick stone. Me mate ate a leaf. He glow now. We keep him in da back.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.8": "Four stones, four colors, say da shaman. Like four bits of one broke pot. Who broke da pot? Don't ask. Shaman go quiet.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.9": "Da stones were here before da humans. Before da orcs even. Before da chickens! Dat is a LONG time.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.10": "Chief say when da first big stone-thing fall, everything change. Da land grow teeth. Da ones with no fear will be fine.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.11": "In da dark da shaman draw a ring wid four marks and say a name nobody know. Den he laugh. Orcs do not like when shaman laugh.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.12": "Da glowing heart on top of da stone. Me throw a rock at it. Rock stay up. Still dere. Don't tell me dat is normal.",
  "dialect.jaymoskingdoms.orc.journal.frag.13": "Old orc say his granddad's granddad seen a land in da sky from da mountain. Den it was gone. He cried. We tell him dat is soft. He cried more."
}
